      "content": "hey so my left calf has been really swollen and kind of sore for like 2 days now. i tried icing it but nothing is helping. i'm also feeling a bit weird, like i can't quite catch my breath and my chest feels tight. do u think this is just anxiety from work stress? i've been super overwhelmed lately.",
