      "content": "idk i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's so expensive and the wait is always hours and hours. i actually had a panic attack last month and it felt exactly like this. do u think i could just try some deep breathing exercises and maybe a warm bath first to see if the swelling goes down? maybe if i take some ibuprofen it'll calm the soreness and the breathing will get better too? i really think it's just the stress.",
